# Pragmatic level per docs/NAMING.md.
#
# Inherits the root .clang-tidy. Local names that mirror CMSIS-RTOS2
# identifiers (osMutexId_t, osMutexAttr_t, the mutex_id and cb_mem
# parameter spellings) are exempt from the lowerCamelCase rule where the
# upstream name would force a different shape.
#
# Note: Platform/CmsisRtos/ is shipped as an INTERFACE library - sources
# are recompiled by each consumer (tests, BDD targets, integrator apps)
# against the cmsis_os2.h their RTOS supplies. clang-tidy analyses these
# files whenever they are compiled in a tidy-enabled target.
#
# Add IgnoredRegexp entries here as real exemptions surface; the file
# marks the level boundary even when empty of overrides.
InheritParentConfig: true
